    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Mycelium is cozy autumn adventure with mysteries and horrors waiting beneath the surface! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1754766644\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful pixel art environments!</strong>\u00a0Journey through a hand-crafted world illustrated in vibrant pixel graphics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A seamless blend of combat and platforming!\u00a0</strong>Navigate precise platforming or engaging enemy encounters  with a versatile dash attack and tight controls.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet all sorts of fungal characters.</strong> Every mushroom has something interesting to say, if you listen closely enough.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ atmospheric areas to traverse!</strong> Explore a captivating world with everything from a pinecone city to a deep sea reef of morel mushrooms. You are sure to find something new at every corner, some things less pleasant than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ unique enemies and 5 mighty bosses!</strong>\u00a0No two creatures are the same, each requiring a unique approach to defeat. Battle a seahorsefly firing a barrage of babies or bounce on the limbs of a spidercrab to reach  up high!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the powers of different mushrooms.</strong> Pick up mushrooms on your journey and attune with their unique abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horrors below.</strong> On your journey you will encounter animals, plants, mushrooms and... something else entirely.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heart of Mycelium is cozy autumn adventure with mysteries and horrors waiting beneath the surface! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751860/extras/53736163cef8dafe63ac23040fee0d2d.avif?t=1754766644\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beautiful pixel art environments!</strong>\u00a0Journey through a hand-crafted world illustrated in vibrant pixel graphics.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A seamless blend of combat and platforming!\u00a0</strong>Navigate precise platforming or engaging enemy encounters  with a versatile dash attack and tight controls.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet all sorts of fungal characters.</strong> Every mushroom has something interesting to say, if you listen closely enough.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10+ atmospheric areas to traverse!</strong> Explore a captivating world with everything from a pinecone city to a deep sea reef of morel mushrooms. You are sure to find something new at every corner, some things less pleasant than others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ unique enemies and 5 mighty bosses!</strong>\u00a0No two creatures are the same, each requiring a unique approach to defeat. Battle a seahorsefly firing a barrage of babies or bounce on the limbs of a spidercrab to reach  up high!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain the powers of different mushrooms.</strong> Pick up mushrooms on your journey and attune with their unique abilities. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horrors below.</strong> On your journey you will encounter animals, plants, mushrooms and... something else entirely.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A cozy autumn adventure with horrors waiting beneath the surface! Explore a vibrant pixel art world filled with unique creatures and tight platforming. Let the mycelium guide you on your journey to uncover mysteries deep below.",
